{
 "about": "The model pickers' ports, params and wire pruning on main 23f11b8e (frontend/tests/universalPorts.pickerParity.test.ts writes `expected` from a verbatim copy of graphStore's configureOpenRouterModel and fetchReplicateSchemaAndConfigure). backend/tests/test_universal_ports.py checks services/universal_ports.py against the same cases. `backendChanges` lists where the backend now differs on purpose.",
 "backendChanges": {
  "replicate list of plain strings": {
   "dynamicOutputPorts": [
    {
     "id": "text",
     "label": "Output",
     "dataType": "Text",
     "required": false
    }
   ],
   "why": "A Replicate model that returns a list of plain strings (a streaming text model) gives a run a `text` output (handlers/replicate_universal.py), so the picker's Image `image` port never received anything; model_schema names `text` too."
  }
 },
